但距离上述触发强劲反弹的极端超卖区仍有距离，尚未达到历史经验上高胜率的左侧买入位置。\n\n**关键价位与风险点：**\n价格目前位于斐波那契23.6%回撤位（1.2143）之上，但受到38.2%回撤位（1.2247）和自动识别阻力位（1.2411）的双重压制。主要风险在于，若价格无法有效突破均线缠绕区域，可能仅是下跌中继，并再次测试下方支撑位1.1974，甚至更低的历史支撑位1.1457。MACD的DIF线（-0.0106）仍处于DEA线（-0.0092）下方，尚未形成金叉，过早介入可能面临继续震荡或再次探底的风险。\n"}, {"symbol": "588000", "asset_name": "华夏上证科创板50成份ETF", "data_type": "cn_fund", "data_type_label": "A股基金", "total_records": 1440, "date_range": {"start": "2020-09-28", "end": "2026-10-08"}, "fund_years": 6.0, "data_quality": {"data_source": "Sina fund NAV", "price_basis": "cumulative_nav", "as_of": "2026-10-08", "latest_verified": null, "expected_records": null, "parsed_records": 1440, "max_gap_days": null, "analysis_start_override": null, "source_history_start": null, "source_history_records": null}, "latest": {"date": "2026-10-08", "price": 1.0686, "display_nav": 1.5387, "cumulative_nav": 1.0686, "display_daily_change": -4.8, "rsi": 32.3, "rsi_7": 21.6, "percentile": 7.2, "status": "弱势区", "suggestion": "可开始关注，等待更好入场点", "daily_change": -4.8, "rsi_updated": "2026-10-08 21:59:38"}, "recent_rsi": [{"date": "2026-09-11", "rsi": 38.0, "percentile": 17.7}, {"date": "2026-09-14", "rsi": 35.7, "percentile": 12.4, "daily_change": -1.62}, {"date": "2026-09-15", "rsi": 39.3, "percentile": 21.2, "daily_change": 1.53}, {"date": "2026-09-16", "rsi": 47.7, "percentile": 48.2, "daily_change": 4.1}, {"date": "2026-09-17", "rsi": 46.6, "percentile": 44.9, "daily_change": -0.61}, {"date": "2026-09-18", "rsi": 52.1, "percentile": 60.6, "daily_change": 2.89}, {"date": "2026-09-21", "rsi": 52.7, "percentile": 62.3, "daily_change": 0.31}, {"date": "2026-09-22", "rsi": 53.6, "percentile": 64.7, "daily_change": 0.46}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "rsi": 53.0, "percentile": 63.0, "daily_change": -0.25}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "rsi": 47.7, "percentile": 48.4, "daily_change": -2.34}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "rsi": 40.4, "percentile": 24.5, "daily_change": -4.04}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "rsi": 42.4, "percentile": 31.2, "daily_change": 0.87}