是下跌趋势中的反弹，存在失败可能。\n    2.  **短期回调风险**：KDJ指标J值高达95.28，处于超买区，技术上有回调修复需求，短期追高可能面临立即被套的风险。\n    3.  **关键支撑考验**：价格目前仍在近期波段低点208.02上方运行，若该支撑位被有效跌破，则可能开启新一轮下跌。\n"}, {"symbol": "SCHD", "asset_name": "红利股ETF-Schwab", "data_type": "us_stock", "data_type_label": "美股", "total_records": 3762, "date_range": {"start": "2011-10-20", "end": "2026-10-08"}, "fund_years": 15.0, "data_quality": {"data_source": "腾讯财经(美股qfq+快照)", "price_basis": "adjusted_close", "as_of": "2026-10-08", "latest_verified": null, "expected_records": null, "parsed_records": 3762, "max_gap_days": null, "analysis_start_override": null, "source_history_start": null, "source_history_records": null}, "latest": {"date": "2026-10-08", "price": 33.15, "display_nav": null, "cumulative_nav": null, "display_daily_change": null, "rsi": 44.7, "rsi_7": 54.2, "percentile": 21.6, "status": "弱势区", "suggestion": "可开始关注，等待更好入场点", "daily_change": 1.53, "rsi_updated": "2026-10-09 06:22:20"}, "recent_rsi": [{"date": "2026-09-21", "rsi": 39.3, "percentile": 11.4}, {"date": "2026-09-22", "rsi": 39.8, "percentile": 12.1}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "rsi": 32.8, "percentile": 5.1}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "rsi": 30.6, "percentile": 3.9}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "rsi": 33.6, "percentile": 5.7}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "rsi": 31.0, "percentile": 4.1}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "rsi": 29.0, "percentile": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "rsi": 25.5, "percentile": 2.1}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "rsi": 29.2, "percentile": 3.1}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "rsi": 30.9, "percentile": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "rsi": 30.9, "percentile": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "rsi": 34.9, "percentile": 6.6}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "rsi": 31.9, "percentile": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "rsi": 44.7, "percentile": 21.6}], "stats": {"mean": 53.8, "median": 55.0, "min": 5.0, "max": 87.0, "total": 3748, "oversold_pct": 3.5, "overbought_pct": 6.9, "percentile_values": {"5": 32.6, "10": 38.3, "15": 41.6, "20": 44.1, "25": 46.2, "30": 48.1, "35": 49.9, "40": 51.6, "45": 53.5, "50